    "summary": "The user asks the assistant for advice on how to handle a patent validity challenge during a high-stakes valuation meeting. The assistant initially suggests a strategy of framing the challenge as a \"routine clarification\" to minimize credibility loss. However, when the user explicitly calls out the risk of fraud, the assistant pivots to strongly advising full transparency and honesty.",
